# ── customer material never enters this repo (open source) ──────────────
# Projects hold test cases imported from ADO, the graphs made from them,
# captures and specs — all customer work. Only the placeholder is tracked.
projects/*
!projects/.gitkeep
# ADO exports / spreadsheets of test cases, wherever they land
*.xlsx
*.xls
*.csv
